flowchart TD
    START([Session created\nstate = CLASSIFYING]) --> IC1

    IC1{mode set by caller?}
    IC1 -->|MANUAL| M["mode = MANUAL\nSkip to SCHEMA_GENERATING\nNo LLM parsing needed"]
    IC1 -->|CHAT| CH["mode = CHAT\nraw_input = user message"]
    IC1 -->|DOC| DOC["mode = DOC\nRead file at file_path"]

    DOC --> EXT{file extension?}
    EXT -->|.yaml .yml .json| STRUCT["structured = true\nDirect parse — no text extraction"]
    EXT -->|.txt .md .pdf| UNSTRUCT["structured = false\nExtract text from file"]

    M --> NEXT1([SCHEMA_GENERATING])
    CH --> NEXT2([PARSING])
    STRUCT --> NEXT2
    UNSTRUCT --> NEXT2
